WEBVTT

00:18:59.117 --> 00:19:00.867
Junge, Junge!

00:19:00.891 --> 00:19:03.235
Kannst du's?

00:19:04.595 --> 00:19:05.875
Baby: Wow.

00:19:05.899 --> 00:19:07.198
DR: Wow.

00:19:07.222 --> 00:19:09.957
Mama, er geht.

00:19:09.981 --> 00:19:12.172
(Gelächter)

00:19:12.196 --> 00:19:14.173
(Applaus)

00:19:14.197 --> 00:19:16.174
DR: Danke

00:19:16.198 --> 00:19:19.198
(Applaus)